      "type": "text",
      "id": "n",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "A put on the tip appends: O(1). h0[:a] is still 1, since h0 reads only\nentry 0. A put on h0 or h1, which are not the tip, copies their live\nentries into a new table first. The log compacts when superseded\nentries outnumber live ones.",
      "originalText": "A put on the tip appends: O(1). h0[:a] is still 1, since h0 reads only\nentry 0. A put on h0 or h1, which are not the tip, copies their live\nentries into a new table first. The log compacts when superseded\nentries outnumber live ones.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
